  "text": "UI Audit Restaurant A\nKIOSK ADMIN\nAhmedabad Flagship Store\nAPP\nRestaurant Admin\nKiosk Admin\nWorkspace\nChoose branch\nAll restaurant · overview\nUI Audit Restaurant A — Main Branch · MAIN\nUI Audit Second Branch A · UIA2\nOrders, tables, inventory and devices belong to this branch.\nKIOSK OPERATIONS\nDashboard\nKiosk Terminals\nOrders\nLive Orders / KDS\nFloor / Tables\nCUSTOMER EXPERIENCE\nMenu & Categories\nMenu Templates\nCustomisations & Tax\nKiosk Welcome Screen\nKiosk Appearance & Content\nKiosk Combos & Deals\nOffers & Coupons\nPAYMENTS & SERVICE\nPayments & Payouts\nReceipt & E-Bill\nPrinters & Devices\nCustomer Feedback\nStaff & Roles (RBAC)\nReports & Analytics\nSYSTEM\nKiosk Settings\nSync & Devices\nSubscription Plans\nAudit Trail Logs\nBackup & Restore\nHelp & Support\nApp Downloads\nAssistant\nLog out\nBusiness overview\n\nLoading workspace · Confirmed sales, open payments and device health\n\nToday\nYesterday\nLast 7 days\nLast 30 days\nThis month\nThis year\nCustom dates\nAll sources\nPOS\nCAPTAIN\nKIOSK\nQR\nWHATSAPP\nONLINE\nUpdating…\n\nLoading consolidated data…\n\nKiosk Dashboard\n\nManage your customer kiosks for UI Audit Restaurant A.\n\nActivated kiosks\n0\nOnline kiosks\n0\nAvailable menu items\n100\nGet your kiosks ready\n1. Set up your menu\n\nChoose a restaurant template or add your own dishes.\n\n2. Design the customer screen\n\nSet your logo, welcome screen and wording.\n\n3. Check payments\n\nReview collection, fees and settlement details.\n\n4. Connect your kiosks\n\nActivate the customer terminal with its own kiosk key.\n\nCollection and restaurant payouts\n\nCustomer collection is separate from money paid to your restaurant.\n\nLoading payout summary…\n\nOpen Payments & Payouts\nGuest menu readiness\nChecking…\n\nPublication has not been verified.\n\n1. Publish your menu. Resolve the errors above, then publish the latest draft.\n2. Confirm terminal delivery. Device acknowledgement has not been verified. Check device acknowledgements\n3. Open a guest menu. Set up a table QR\n4. Verify staff receive an order. Use a supervised test in your configured test environment. Confirm the correct counter and kitchen receive it. This checklist does not place or pay for an order.\nOpen menu & publish\n\nPublication confirms the server menu. Check a guest QR page or kiosk and place a test order to verify delivery to staff.\n\nBefore your first guest\nYour branch setup checklist\nCheck setup again\n\nA setup check verifies configuration. Place a small test order and confirm staff receive it before opening service.\n\nJAMAN AI\nKELVIONTECH ENTERPRISE\nLocal Engine Active\nOFFLINE-FIRST INDIAN RESTAURANT SYSTEM\nv2.0 • POWERED BY KELVIONTECH\n\nYOUR RESTAURANT WORKSPACE\n\nKIOSK MANAGEMENT\nCore Engine Ready\n•\nDatabase Initialized\n•\nLocal-First Mode",
